      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Confirmed this problem.\nThe problem started since 2018.4.4 i think. Before 2017 upgrade, logins are without problem.\n\nNow if i restart / start pc (so everything is fresh) i saw there is always login loops, repeating 4-5x and then it just forgot my login. (the progress bar goes to ~76% and stopped)\n\nIndeed, if i restart later VRChat while PC is still running, login went immediately without problems.\n\nIt's very annoying problem. This should fixed because it has no sense why login should not work.\nBecause if i enter login / pass again, i just suddely login without problems. Yes, that makes no sense.\n\nThis problem affects many users, so it should fixed asap.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-27T03:46:37.263Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "when a person first starts their computer or restarts it and gets back on VRChat it spins then after 4-5 spins it prompts you to login, when you quit the game and didnt turn your computer off or restarting it it logins you in just fine .\n\nMore Users have also reported having to login to the sdk",
